请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-01-low-power-008

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
文字叠在背景图上那种,显示一行带数字的话,点一下能导航去充电站,要有红色危险提示

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "文字叠在背景图上那种,显示一行带数字的话,点一下能导航去充电站,要有红色危险提示",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToIntent",
      "args": {
        "intentName": "StartNavigate",
        "params": {
          "dstLocation": {
            "latitude": "22.3193",
            "longitude": "114.1694"
          },
          "trafficpe": "Drive"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModel": {
    "value": {
      "power": {
        "title": "低电模式",
        "line": "电量 12% · 立即充电",
        "alert": "危险",
        "actionText": "导航充电站",
        "asset": "resources/base/media/icon_charge.png"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "assetRef": "charge_icon",
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_charge.png",
      "use": "low power charging background icon",
      "description": "低电/省电场景的充电闪电图标，可作为暗色舞台上的背景视觉锚点。",
      "bindTo": "/power/asset",
      "static": true
    }
  ]
}

